OL,3,GNEWSAThe story of how golf balls got
OL,4,Atheir dimples
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn the late 19th Century, golf balls
OL,7,Fwere totally smooth, but players soon
OL,8,Fdiscovered that they did not fly as
OL,9,Fwell as hoped.
OL,11,FPlayers found that once balls had
OL,12,Fpicked up a few dents and chips, they
OL,13,Fflew straighter and further, with some
OL,14,Fhammering grooves into them.
OL,16,FHowever, this all changed when William
OL,17,FTaylor - an engineer who founded a
OL,18,Fcompany in Leicester - took up the
OL,19,Fsport and designed the dimples we know
OL,20,Fand love today.
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,366,360,200,160,0,100
