OL,3,GNEWSAThe story of how golf balls got
OL,4,Atheir dimples
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Golf was supposed to be the relaxing
OL,7,Fhobby, but then of course he turned it
OL,8,Finto an engineering problem. I suppose
OL,9,Fit's just that kind of mind that he
OL,10,Fcouldn't resist," Sophie Edwards - of
OL,11,FMore Than Just a Gift at Narborough
OL,12,FHall, where Taylor designed his
OL,13,Fdimples, said.
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
